# Report 030 (c-1): Settings > Speaker on a board with sound (the harness's fake asound tree, command "sound card": the
# tablet's HDA Intel PCH card with its Master control). The root menu gets Speaker after Screen: a native slider (100 %
# to 0 %, 10 % steps) on the volume page's logic; Right / Left change the volume (the audio service's fixture), the row
# reads it back. A release build. Review only: no golden.
title settings speaker
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
sound card
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen Speaker Wi-Fi Bluetooth Launcher Touch Apps Updates User "Date & Time" System
expect_text 50%
shot settings_speaker_root
header settings_speaker_root Settings
key DOWN
wait 300
shot settings_speaker_selected
key RIGHT
wait 500
expect_text 60%
shot settings_speaker_louder
key LEFT
wait 500
key LEFT
wait 500
expect_text 40%
shot settings_speaker_quieter
